WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:02.120
- Do I look like Queen Amidala?

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.158
Doo doo!

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.132
Now I'm Amidala, right?

00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:19.813
- I was really excited to hear about the

00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:21.542
Covergirl collection, if only because it

00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:23.516
allows us fangirls to get a little bit

00:00:23.516 --> 00:00:25.222
more nerdy-ness into our purses

00:00:25.222 --> 00:00:27.277
and into our bathrooms.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:29.047
- It's no longer just like, "Hey look,

00:00:29.047 --> 00:00:31.648
a Barbie line!" it's
like, "Hey, Star Wars."

00:00:32.768 --> 00:00:35.032
- [Offscreen] Okay, let's do this!

00:00:35.032 --> 00:00:36.054
- This is definitely like a cloudy,

00:00:36.054 --> 00:00:38.434
metallic gray, Palpatine skin gray,

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.315
Millennium Falcon gray.

00:00:40.315 --> 00:00:41.371
- Oh, got it on my tooth, because

00:00:41.371 --> 00:00:42.695
that's why I don't wear makeup.

00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:45.690
- Nope, nothing special. It looks off.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.932
- It's pretty opaque on my arm,

00:00:46.932 --> 00:00:48.592
it's very metallic and shiny.

00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:50.728
- I look like I was stranded on Hoth.

00:00:51.548 --> 00:00:53.491
- You'd have to wear a base
and layer this over it.

00:00:53.491 --> 00:00:57.648
- I guess if I was gonna
give this color a name,

00:00:57.648 --> 00:01:00.684
it would be like, Tauntaun Innards.

00:01:01.489 --> 00:01:02.739
- [Offscreen] Lilac.

00:01:03.127 --> 00:01:05.333
- Like the skies of
Coruscant, I don't know.

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:06.633
Can't the sky be every color?

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:09.071
- Once again, metallic, kind of.

00:01:09.071 --> 00:01:10.975
Not really for my skin color, but

00:01:10.975 --> 00:01:12.635
let's see, maybe I'll be surprised.

00:01:12.635 --> 00:01:14.168
- It's a little splotchy,
but, you know what?

00:01:14.168 --> 00:01:15.271
I could totally make this work.

00:01:15.271 --> 00:01:16.873
- I definitely wish
they had names, though.

00:01:16.873 --> 00:01:19.148
Like this one, is 100% Mara Jade.

00:01:19.148 --> 00:01:21.609
- I'm gonna go with Jar Jar Binks.

00:01:21.609 --> 00:01:22.434
- These are all metallics,

00:01:22.434 --> 00:01:23.896
I've noticed so far, so hopefully

00:01:23.896 --> 00:01:25.254
this one is metallic too otherwise

00:01:25.254 --> 00:01:26.567
I'll be, I'll be disappointed.

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:28.934
- I feel like I'm applying
some sort of like, honey.

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:30.827
- Looks like an autumn sunset on my lips,

00:01:30.827 --> 00:01:32.592
when I would much rather look like 3PO.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.833
- Okay, this is super pretty.

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.005
- This is almost to par with some of

00:01:36.005 --> 00:01:37.189
the other metallic lipsticks that I own.

00:01:37.189 --> 00:01:39.534
- I feel like it just blends
in with my skin color.

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:42.134
- It's cool, it's metallic,
definitely needs a base, though.

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:44.050
- Obviously I'm gonna name it C-3PO.

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:46.291
- It's gold, it's like
the suns of Tatooine.

00:01:46.291 --> 00:01:49.565
- Like, Palpatine's red
guard, in that one movie.

00:01:49.565 --> 00:01:51.005
And then his guard, like went away,

00:01:51.005 --> 00:01:52.652
and we never saw them again,
but they were pretty cool.

00:01:52.652 --> 00:01:54.614
- Reds can be kind of tricky.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.168
- Oh this is pretty, I actually
really like this color.

00:01:57.168 --> 00:01:58.632
- Wow, this is not going on nicely,

00:01:58.632 --> 00:02:00.048
I am not allowed to wear red.

00:02:00.048 --> 00:02:01.349
- The other thing about metallics,

00:02:01.349 --> 00:02:02.985
is it's basically glitter.

00:02:02.985 --> 00:02:05.005
- Oddly, I like this.

00:02:05.005 --> 00:02:06.027
This could easily be named, like,

00:02:06.027 --> 00:02:08.407
Bloodstripe, or Slave Leia.

00:02:08.407 --> 00:02:10.392
- Darth Maul, that's it's name.

00:02:10.392 --> 00:02:11.843
- I was gonna say purple was

00:02:11.843 --> 00:02:13.910
gonna be like, Mace Windu's lightsaber

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:15.303
because this is purple.

00:02:15.303 --> 00:02:17.473
- I wanna call this like, Senator Amidala,

00:02:17.473 --> 00:02:20.213
after her purple costume
that I love so much.

00:02:20.213 --> 00:02:21.410
- Halloween is coming up,

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.929
I love wearing super dark colors.

00:02:23.929 --> 00:02:25.310
- Oh man, this is so dark.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:27.447
- It doesn't really go on smoothly.

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:28.886
- It's gonna be a pretty color,

00:02:28.886 --> 00:02:30.929
once I finally get it in.

00:02:30.929 --> 00:02:33.124
- I drew a little outside
the lines, oh god.

00:02:33.124 --> 00:02:34.888
- I'm gonna call it Alderaan.

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:37.430
- Okay so now we're
moving onto the mascaras,

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:39.613
there are ten different sayings,

00:02:39.613 --> 00:02:41.645
but there are only two
different kinds of mascara,

00:02:41.645 --> 00:02:43.432
so water-proof and not water-proof.

00:02:43.432 --> 00:02:45.964
- "I feel the good in you,"
that's a little dirty.

00:02:45.964 --> 00:02:47.111
- "May the force be with you."

00:02:47.111 --> 00:02:48.331
- "Indeed you are powerful," it's like

00:02:48.331 --> 00:02:50.224
you wake up in the morning, put it on,

00:02:50.224 --> 00:02:51.443
and go take on the world.

00:02:51.443 --> 00:02:52.883
- These all could have been lightsabers,

00:02:52.883 --> 00:02:54.044
so there could have been like a neon blue,

00:02:54.044 --> 00:02:56.888
a neon red, a neon green, a neon purple.

00:02:56.888 --> 00:02:58.966
(lightsaber noises)

00:02:58.966 --> 00:03:01.381
- If you want to collect 1-10, do it,

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:02.983
because if you guys are real nerds,

00:03:02.983 --> 00:03:04.562
you will collect all the things.

00:03:04.562 --> 00:03:06.501
- This is actually really, really good.

00:03:06.501 --> 00:03:07.905
- This is a good mascara.

00:03:07.905 --> 00:03:10.123
- I can see in my youth, of loving

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:11.388
to collect stuff, I would be like,

00:03:11.388 --> 00:03:13.570
"I need all 10 of these
or someone's gonna die."

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:16.589
- I like that you're
targeting us nerd girls,

00:03:16.589 --> 00:03:19.085
I wish you had more
colors for people like me.

00:03:19.085 --> 00:03:21.883
- It's cool just to know that they're

00:03:21.883 --> 00:03:24.646
marketing something for female fans.

00:03:24.646 --> 00:03:26.550
- I am just proud to know that

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:28.384
fangirls are being represented.

